msgstr ""

#: src/Core/Operations/PrivacyInventory.php:454
msgid "If you turn on the AI assistant, it sends the text each feature needs to the AI provider you chose in the WordPress Connectors screen, and keeps a log of what the AI suggested and what a person decided. For a summary, a search description or an image caption that is the headline and the first 600 characters of the article, and never the author. A caption request also sends the photo’s credit, but only if you allow author names."
